/**
 * Static require map for bundled exercise demonstration images.
 *
 * React Native's Metro bundler only resolves `require()` calls with literal
 * string paths, so each asset must be listed explicitly here (no dynamic
 * `require(`...${id}`)`). Images are optimized WebP (~17 KB each) generated by
 * `scripts/fetch-exercise-images.mjs` from the public-domain free-exercise-db.
 *
 * Keys match Exercise.id in `@/data/exercises`. Ids without an entry here
 * (machine-lateral-raise, single-leg-calf-raise, burpee) have no match in
 * free-exercise-db and fall back to the muscle-group icon.
 */

